On behalf of the LaTeX Team I'd like to announce the public beta test of
the new LaTeX release (officially dated 2005/12/01).

Location on CTAN: macros/latex/beta-test

This directory contains four zip files:

   latex2e.zip
   tools.zip
   graphics.zip
   cyrillic.zip

Documentation and installation instructions are included in the
latex2e.zip archive.

Problems should be reported via the normal LaTeX bug reporting
mechanism at

   http://www.latex-project.org/bugs-upload.html

    Rainer Schöpf



